+
+| Upstream names | On DeepSeek Harness |
+|---|---|
+| `Bash` | the `pwsh` tool (Windows) |
+| `Read` / `Write` / `Edit` | `read` / `write` / `edit` |
+| `Glob` / `Grep` | `glob` / `grep` |
